arStrings.szText:
Your {c_important}Catalyst{/c} now deals Poison and or Poisoning damage. Enemies damaged by it take {c_random}{dot:POISONING_TOOLTIP}{/c} Poisoning damage over {c_number}{SF_9}{/c} seconds. This effect can only happen on each enemy every {c_number}{SF_8}{/c} seconds.

While equipped, your Poison Damage Bonus is equal to that of your highest Damage Type Bonus.{if:SF_6}

Deactivates monster {c_important}Vampiric{/c} effects for {c_number}{SF_4}{/c} seconds.{/if}
